message: "This research code and its results are free to use, share and build on with credit. Please cite it as below or credit: Source: Prospect Actuary (kylemschyma.github.io/prospect-actuary)."
title: "Prospect Actuary research: fantasy football prospect and trade-value models built with actuarial methods"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Prospect Actuary"
    website: "https://kylemschyma.github.io/prospect-actuary/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KyleMSchyma/Football"
url: "https://kylemschyma.github.io/prospect-actuary/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - fantasy football
  - NFL draft prospects
  - dynasty trade values
  - actuarial science
  - credibility theory
  - R
abstract: >-
  R code, research write-ups and results behind Prospect Actuary: rookie position models, pre-draft and post-draft
  grades, the mixed draft model, redraft and dynasty trade values (credibility, survival, aging, present value) and
  the weekly refresh. Code is MIT; write-ups, results and outputs are CC BY 4.0. Third-party source data keeps its own
  terms.
